# 测试
tests/
**/tests/
test/
__tests__/
src/test/
src/androidTest/
*.test.*
*.spec.*
*_test.*
*_test.go
web/src/**/__tests__/
web/src/**/__snapshots__/
coverage/

# 本地构建、配置与工具输出
**/node_modules/
web/dist/
internal/webassets/dist/
.artifacts/
.local/
.tanstack/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.tsbuildinfo
playwright-report/
test-results/
*.out
*.exe
